---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
const groupEmail = 'bookingsdrw@flyingdoctor.net.au';
---
<Base title="Programs & Groups" description="Curriculum-linked immersive learning at the Bombing of Darwin Experience — history, STEM, aviation and innovation. Step inside 'PAPA', a decommissioned RFDS Pilatus PC-12.">
  <PageHeader
    record="Education & groups"
    title="Programs & Groups"
    lede="Bring history to life through immersive learning experiences."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose prose--serif measure" style="margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px);">
        <p>The 1942 Bombing of Darwin Experience offers students a powerful opportunity to explore the events of 19 February 1942 through immersive technology, authentic storytelling and interactive learning.</p>
        <p>Students then continue into the Royal Flying Doctor Service Experience, where they discover how aviation, communication and innovation have transformed healthcare across remote Australia.</p>
        <p>Together, in one location, the two experiences support learning across Australian history, wartime studies, STEM, geography, aviation and innovation.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">The visit</p>
          <dl class="deflist">
            <div><dt>Suitable for</dt><dd>Primary, secondary and tertiary students</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Duration</dt><dd>Approximately 2 hours</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Group capacity</dt><dd>Up to 150 students</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Rates</dt><dd>School group rates are available on request.</dd></div>
            <div>
              <dt>Funding<br />Assistance</dt>
              <dd>Eligible schools may also be able to access funding assistance through the <a href="https://northernterritory.com/tours/school-excursions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-inline">NT Learning Adventures Save &amp; Learn Program</a>.</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Learning highlights</p>
          <ul class="curric">
            <li>Stand in the place where the Bombing of Darwin air raids swept across Darwin Harbour.</li>
            <li>Experience virtual reality, holographic presentations and immersive storytelling.</li>
            <li>Step inside PAPA, a decommissioned RFDS Pilatus PC-12 aircraft that once supported healthcare across remote Australia.</li>
            <li>Discover local stories and perspectives connected to the Northern Territory and wartime history.</li>
            <li>Complete an interactive discovery trail during your visit.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Decommissioned RFDS Pilatus PC-12 'PAPA' Underneath The Visit and Highlights -->
      <article class="papa card">
        <div class="papa__media">
          <img src="/images/BOD_PC12.webp" alt="PAPA, a decommissioned RFDS Pilatus PC-12 aircraft on display at Stokes Hill Wharf" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <div class="papa__body">
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--gold">ON-SITE AIRCRAFT</p>
          <h3 class="papa__h">STEP INSIDE 'PAPA'.</h3>
          <p class="prose prose--serif">
            Step inside PAPA, a decommissioned RFDS Pilatus PC-12 aircraft that once flew life-saving aeromedical missions across remote Australia. Students can sit in the cockpit, explore the medical cabin, and discover the technology and human dedication behind the Royal Flying Doctor Service.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="cta">
        <p class="prose prose--serif measure" style="margin-bottom:26px;">
          To discuss your school's requirements or make a booking, please contact our Reservations Team.
        </p>
        <a class="btn-book" href={`mailto:${groupEmail}`}>ENQUIRE ABOUT GROUP BOOKINGS</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-12);
    }
  }
  .deflist div {
    padding: var(--space-3) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
  .deflist dt {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .deflist dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
  }
  .curric {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .curric li {
    padding: var(--space-3) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
    position: relative;
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
  }
  .curric li::before {
    content: "—";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .papa {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    background: var(--surface-panel);
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .papa {
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  .papa__media {
    position: relative;
    background: #000;
    min-height: 260px;
  }
  .papa__media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .papa__body {
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .papa__h {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-4);
  }
  .eyebrow--gold {
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .cta {
    padding: var(--space-8);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    background: var(--surface-panel);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cta .measure {
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .btn-book {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--text-inverse);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn-book:hover {
    background: var(--gold-light, #d4b574);
  }
</style>
